      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Steward also helped establish the first cemetery, Ash Creek, where early settlers like Dave Morrison are buried.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azle%2C_Texas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Azle’s economy grew from wheat, corn, and cotton to dairy farming in the early 1900s, supplying milk to Fort Worth creameries.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        26,
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
