      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Azle%2C_Texas",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Today, Azle is known for its marching band, the Azle Marching Green Pride, and its high‑school team, the Fighting Azle Hornets.",
